###### EMPLOYEES — modul employee (EmployeeController) ######
### Base: {{baseUrl}}/employees
### Data karyawan operasional (name 3-100 char, email format valid).
### GET list & GET by ID cukup login (tanpa authority khusus);
### write butuh employee.create / employee.update / employee.delete.

### Create — authority employee.create
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Andi Kasir",
    "email": "andi@rascal.id",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "position": "Cashier",
    "department": "Front of House",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Search active or GetAll (cukup login)
### filter: keyword; pagination standar page=&size=
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?keyword=andi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search - pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get by ID (cukup login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Full update (PUT) — authority employee.update, semua field wajib seperti create
PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Andi Kasir",
    "email": "andi@rascal.id",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "position": "Senior Cashier",
    "department": "Front of House",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Partial update (PATCH) — authority employee.update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "position": "Senior Cashier"
}

### Restore soft-deleted — authority employee.update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (soft delete) — authority employee.delete, response 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate — authority employee.update
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Suspend — authority employee.update
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### VALIDATION
### ========================================

### Get by ID - not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
